[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_CHIPS]
Stallioncon Valley Computing Center

[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_CHIPS_desc]
Chips, a magical item from the human world, which are not only the core of a computer, but also a force that can change the world.\nIntelligence shows that many of the cutting-edge technologies related to human world chip were born in a place called “Silicon Valley”, which seems to be a cheap mock-up of our “Stallioncon Valley”. Although we don’t know who came first, but hey, we have magic, what do they have?

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_CHIPS]
骏马谷计算中心

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_CHIPS_desc]
芯片，一种来自人类世界的神奇物品，它们不仅仅是一种计算机的核心，更是一种能够世界的力量。\n情报显示，人类世界芯片相关尖端科技许多诞生在一个名为“硅谷”的地方，似乎有点像我们“骏马谷”的廉价抄袭版。虽然时间上不知道谁先谁后，但是起码，我们有魔法，他们有什么？

